<title>LITHUANIA: Yields rise on 91-day Lithuania T-bills.</title>
<headline>Yields rise on 91-day Lithuania T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yields rose on 91-day Lithuanian T-bills at Monday's auction and the 50 million litas issue was undersubscribed, the central bank said.</p>
<p> MATURITY  AV.YIELD  LAST   MIN/MAX  ISSUE  BID   SOLD</p>
<p> 91-days    9.32     8.30  8.30/9.99  50   57.842 34.842</p>
<p>The settlement date is June 25 and the bills mature on September 25.</p>
<p>The next auction is on Tuesday when 50 million litas of 91-day paper will be offered.</p>
<p>-- Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +371 721 52 40</p>
</text>
